           MOVE 'INGRESA PERFORM 100 '      TO WTRC0-DESCRIPCION
           MOVE SPACES                      TO WTRC0-VALOR-ALF
      *
            EXEC CICS
              IGNORE CONDITION ERROR
            END-EXEC

            IF EIBRESP NOT EQUAL DFHRESP(NORMAL)
              MOVE CTE-99             TO UGNCTABA-COD-RETURN
