      *COL01-I
              PERFORM 125-CNS-IVAVIG
      *COL01-F
              PERFORM 130-CNS-PORC-INCEN
            END-IF
      *
            MOVE '100-INICIO          '      TO WTRC0-PARRAFO
            MOVE 'TERMINA PERFORM 100 '      TO WTRC0-DESCRIPCION
