      ******************************************************************
       120-VALIDA-ENTRADA.
      *
           MOVE '120-VALIDA-ENTRADA'      TO WTRC0-PARRAFO
           MOVE 'INGRESA PERFORM 120'     TO WTRC0-DESCRIPCION
           MOVE SPACES                    TO WTRC0-VALOR-ALF
      *
           IF UGNCTABA-OPCION EQUAL SPACES OR LOW-VALUES
              MOVE '120-VALIDA-ENTRADA'   TO WTRC0-PARRAFO
              MOVE 'UGNCTABA-OPCION'      TO WTRC0-DESCRIPCION
              MOVE 'NO INFORMADA'         TO WTRC0-VALOR-ALF
