              MOVE CTE-10                 TO UGNCTABA-COD-RETURN
              MOVE CTE-UGE0000            TO UGNCTABA-COD-ERROR
              MOVE 'CAMPO OPCION'         TO UGNCTABA-VAR1-ERROR
              MOVE 'NO INFORMADO'         TO UGNCTABA-VAR2-ERROR
              PERFORM 300-FINAL
           END-IF
      *
           IF UGNCTABA-OPCION NOT EQUAL CTE-T AND CTE-C
              MOVE '120-VALIDA-ENTRADA'   TO WTRC0-PARRAFO
              MOVE 'UGNCTABA-OPCION'      TO WTRC0-DESCRIPCION
              MOVE 'NO VALIDO'            TO WTRC0-VALOR-ALF
      *
              MOVE CTE-10                 TO UGNCTABA-COD-RETURN
              MOVE CTE-UGE0000            TO UGNCTABA-COD-ERROR
              MOVE 'CAMPO OPCION'         TO UGNCTABA-VAR1-ERROR
              MOVE 'DEBER SER T, N.'      TO UGNCTABA-VAR2-ERROR
              PERFORM 300-FINAL
           END-IF
      *
           IF UGNCTABA-OPCION EQUAL CTE-T
            IF UGNCTABA-TIP-CTE EQUAL SPACES OR LOW-VALUES
              MOVE '120-VALIDA-ENTRADA'   TO WTRC0-PARRAFO
              MOVE 'UGNCTABA-TIP-CTE'     TO WTRC0-DESCRIPCION
              MOVE 'NO INFORMADO'         TO WTRC0-VALOR-ALF
      *
              MOVE CTE-10                 TO UGNCTABA-COD-RETURN
              MOVE CTE-UGE0000            TO UGNCTABA-COD-ERROR
              MOVE 'TIPO DE CLIENTE'      TO UGNCTABA-VAR1-ERROR
              MOVE 'NO INFORMADO'         TO UGNCTABA-VAR2-ERROR
              PERFORM 300-FINAL
            END-IF
           END-IF
      *
           IF UGNCTABA-SUBPRO  EQUAL SPACES OR LOW-VALUES
              MOVE '120-VALIDA-ENTRADA'   TO WTRC0-PARRAFO
              MOVE 'UGNCTABA-SUBPRO'       TO WTRC0-DESCRIPCION
              MOVE 'NO INFORMADO'         TO WTRC0-VALOR-ALF
      *
              MOVE CTE-10                 TO UGNCTABA-COD-RETURN
              MOVE CTE-UGE0000            TO UGNCTABA-COD-ERROR
              MOVE 'SUBPRODUCTO'          TO UGNCTABA-VAR1-ERROR
              MOVE 'NO INFORMADO'         TO UGNCTABA-VAR2-ERROR
              PERFORM 300-FINAL
           END-IF
      *
           IF UGNCTABA-PLAZO IS NOT NUMERIC
              MOVE '120-VALIDA-ENTRADA'   TO WTRC0-PARRAFO
              MOVE 'UGNCTABA-PLAZO'       TO WTRC0-DESCRIPCION
              MOVE 'NO VALIDO'            TO WTRC0-VALOR-ALF
      *
              MOVE CTE-10                 TO UGNCTABA-COD-RETURN
              MOVE CTE-UGE0000            TO UGNCTABA-COD-ERROR
              MOVE 'PLAZO NO VALIDO'      TO UGNCTABA-VAR1-ERROR
              MOVE SPACES                 TO UGNCTABA-VAR2-ERROR
              PERFORM 300-FINAL
           END-IF
      *
           IF UGNCTABA-VRVIVIEN IS NOT NUMERIC
              MOVE '120-VALIDA-ENTRADA'   TO WTRC0-PARRAFO
              MOVE 'UGNCTABA-VRVIVIEN'    TO WTRC0-DESCRIPCION
              MOVE 'NO VALIDO'            TO WTRC0-VALOR-ALF
      *
              MOVE CTE-10                 TO UGNCTABA-COD-RETURN
              MOVE CTE-UGE0000            TO UGNCTABA-COD-ERROR
              MOVE 'VALOR VIVIENDA'       TO UGNCTABA-VAR1-ERROR
              MOVE 'NO VALIDO'            TO UGNCTABA-VAR2-ERROR
              PERFORM 300-FINAL
           END-IF
      *
           IF UGNCTABA-VRVIVIEN <= ZEROS
              MOVE '120-VALIDA-ENTRADA'   TO WTRC0-PARRAFO
              MOVE 'UGNCTABA-VRVIVIEN'    TO WTRC0-DESCRIPCION
              MOVE 'MENOR QUE CERO'       TO WTRC0-VALOR-ALF
      *
              MOVE CTE-10                 TO UGNCTABA-COD-RETURN
              MOVE CTE-UGE0000            TO UGNCTABA-COD-ERROR
              MOVE 'VALOR VIVIENDA'       TO UGNCTABA-VAR1-ERROR
              MOVE 'DEBE SER MAYOR A 0'   TO UGNCTABA-VAR2-ERROR
              PERFORM 300-FINAL
           END-IF
      *
           IF UGNCTABA-IMPFINAN IS NOT NUMERIC
              MOVE '120-VALIDA-ENTRADA'   TO WTRC0-PARRAFO
              MOVE 'UGNCTABA-IMPFINAN'    TO WTRC0-DESCRIPCION
              MOVE 'NO VALIDO'            TO WTRC0-VALOR-ALF
      *
              MOVE CTE-10                 TO UGNCTABA-COD-RETURN
              MOVE CTE-UGE0000            TO UGNCTABA-COD-ERROR
              MOVE 'PVE0004 IMPORTE '     TO UGNCTABA-VAR1-ERROR
              MOVE 'SOLICITADO NO VALIDO' TO UGNCTABA-VAR2-ERROR
              PERFORM 300-FINAL
           END-IF
      *
           IF UGNCTABA-IMPFINAN <= ZEROS
              MOVE '120-VALIDA-ENTRADA'   TO WTRC0-PARRAFO
              MOVE 'UGNCTABA-IMPFINAN'    TO WTRC0-DESCRIPCION
              MOVE 'MENOR QUE CERO'       TO WTRC0-VALOR-ALF
      *
              MOVE CTE-10                 TO UGNCTABA-COD-RETURN
              MOVE CTE-UGE0000            TO UGNCTABA-COD-ERROR
              MOVE 'IMPORTE SOLICITADO'   TO UGNCTABA-VAR1-ERROR
              MOVE 'DEBE SER MAYOR A 0'   TO UGNCTABA-VAR2-ERROR
              PERFORM 300-FINAL
           END-IF
      *
           IF UGNCTABA-FECOPERA EQUAL SPACES OR LOW-VALUES
              MOVE '120-VALIDA-ENTRADA'   TO WTRC0-PARRAFO
              MOVE 'UGNCTABA-FECOPERA'     TO WTRC0-DESCRIPCION
              MOVE 'NO INFORMADA'         TO WTRC0-VALOR-ALF
      *
              MOVE CTE-10                 TO UGNCTABA-COD-RETURN
              MOVE CTE-UGE0000            TO UGNCTABA-COD-ERROR
              MOVE 'FECHA DE OPERACION'   TO UGNCTABA-VAR1-ERROR
              MOVE 'NO INFORMADA'         TO UGNCTABA-VAR2-ERROR
              PERFORM 300-FINAL
           END-IF
      *
           IF UGNCTABA-OPCION NOT EQUAL CTE-C
             IF UGNCTABA-FECNACI EQUAL SPACES OR LOW-VALUES
                MOVE '120-VALIDA-ENTRADA'   TO WTRC0-PARRAFO
                MOVE 'UGNCTABA-FECNACI'      TO WTRC0-DESCRIPCION
                MOVE 'NO INFORMADA'         TO WTRC0-VALOR-ALF
      *
                MOVE CTE-10                 TO UGNCTABA-COD-RETURN
                MOVE CTE-UGE0000            TO UGNCTABA-COD-ERROR
                MOVE 'FECHA DE NACIMIENTO'  TO UGNCTABA-VAR1-ERROR
                MOVE 'NO INFORMADA'         TO UGNCTABA-VAR2-ERROR
                PERFORM 300-FINAL
             END-IF
           END-IF
      *
           MOVE '120-VALIDA-ENTRADA'      TO WTRC0-PARRAFO
           MOVE 'TERMINA PERFORM 120'     TO WTRC0-DESCRIPCION
           MOVE SPACES                    TO WTRC0-VALOR-ALF.
      *COL01-I
      ******************************************************************
      *                        125-CNS-IVAVIG                          *
      *  CONSULTA EL PORCENTAJE DEL IVA VIGENTE PARA CALCULAR SEGURO   *
      *  INCENDIO Y TERREMOTO                                          *
      ******************************************************************
       125-CNS-IVAVIG.
      *COL02-INI
      *    INITIALIZE UGTCT37
           INITIALIZE UGTCRFI
      *    MOVE CTE-0821                  TO T37-SECCION
      *    MOVE CTE-VDGN4-3               TO T37-ELEMENTO
           MOVE CTE-IVA                   TO RFI-UGIDXREF
           MOVE UGNCTABA-FECOPERA         TO RFI-FECOVALI
      *COL02-FIN
      *COL02-INI
           EXEC SQL
               SELECT UGTIPINT
               INTO :RFI-UGTIPINT
               FROM UGDTRFI
               WHERE UGIDXREF =  :RFI-UGIDXREF
               AND   FECOVALI = (SELECT MAX(FECOVALI)
                                 FROM UGDTRFI
                                 WHERE UGIDXREF = :RFI-UGIDXREF
                                 AND FECOVALI  <= :RFI-FECOVALI)
           END-EXEC
      *
      *      EXEC SQL
      *          SELECT RESTO
      *            INTO :T37-RESTO
      *            FROM UGDTT37
      *           WHERE SECCION  = :T37-SECCION
      *             AND ELEMENTO = :T37-ELEMENTO
      *      END-EXEC
      *COL02-FIN

           MOVE SQLCODE                   TO DB2-RETURN-CDE

           EVALUATE TRUE
             WHEN DB2-OK
      *COL02-INI
      *         MOVE T37-RESTO(1:1)         TO WS-IVA-ENT
      *         MOVE T37-RESTO(3:2)         TO WS-IVA-DEC
                MOVE '1'                    TO WS-IVA-ENT
                MOVE RFI-UGTIPINT           TO WS-IVA-DEC
      *COL02-FIN

             WHEN DB2-NOTFND
                MOVE CTE-10                 TO UGNCTABA-COD-RETURN
                MOVE CTE-UGE0000            TO UGNCTABA-COD-ERROR
                MOVE 'NO EXISTE'            TO UGNCTABA-VAR1-ERROR
      *COL02-INI
      *         MOVE 'SECCION 0821'         TO UGNCTABA-VAR2-ERROR
                MOVE 'REGISTRO EN TABLA'    TO UGNCTABA-VAR2-ERROR
      *COL02-FIN
                PERFORM 300-FINAL
      *
             WHEN DB2-RECATR1
             WHEN DB2-RECATR2
                MOVE CTE-UGE0000          TO UGNCTABA-COD-ERROR
                MOVE 'RECURSO ATRAPADO '  TO UGNCTABA-VAR1-ERROR
                MOVE 'UGDTT37'            TO UGNCTABA-VAR2-ERROR
                PERFORM 300-FINAL
      *
             WHEN OTHER
               MOVE CTE-90                 TO UGNCTABA-COD-RETURN
               MOVE CTE-UGE0000            TO UGNCTABA-COD-ERROR
               MOVE 'ERROR SELECT UGDTT37' TO UGNCTABA-VAR1-ERROR
               MOVE 'SECCION 9649.CGO:'    TO UGNCTABA-VAR2-ERROR(1:17)
               MOVE SQLCODE                TO UGNCTABA-VAR2-ERROR(18:)
               PERFORM 300-FINAL
           END-EVALUATE.
      *COL01-F
      *
      ******************************************************************
      *                  130-CNS-PORC-INCEN                            *
      * CONSULTA EL PORCENTAJE PARA EL CALCULO DEL SEGURO DE INCENDIO  *
      * Y TERREMOTO                                                    *
      ******************************************************************
       130-CNS-PORC-INCEN.
      *
           MOVE '130-CNS-PORC-INCEN'     TO WTRC0-PARRAFO
           MOVE 'INGRESA PERFORM 130'    TO WTRC0-DESCRIPCION
           MOVE SPACES                   TO WTRC0-VALOR-ALF
      *
           INITIALIZE UGTCT37

           MOVE CTE-9649                     TO T37-SECCION
           IF UGNCTABA-TIP-CTE = CTE-C
             MOVE 'CLASICO'                  TO T37-ELEMENTO
           ELSE
             MOVE 'PREMIUM'                  TO T37-ELEMENTO
           END-IF

             EXEC SQL
                 SELECT RESTO
                   INTO :T37-RESTO
                   FROM UGDTT37
                  WHERE SECCION  = :T37-SECCION
                    AND ELEMENTO = :T37-ELEMENTO
             END-EXEC

           MOVE SQLCODE                       TO DB2-RETURN-CDE

           EVALUATE TRUE
             WHEN DB2-OK
              MOVE T37-RESTO(1:2)         TO WS-PORC-ENT
              MOVE T37-RESTO(4:5)         TO WS-PORC-DEC
      *
             WHEN DB2-NOTFND
              MOVE CTE-10                 TO UGNCTABA-COD-RETURN
              MOVE CTE-UGE0000            TO UGNCTABA-COD-ERROR
              MOVE 'NO EXISTE'            TO UGNCTABA-VAR1-ERROR
              MOVE 'SECCION 9649'         TO UGNCTABA-VAR2-ERROR
              PERFORM 300-FINAL
      *
              WHEN DB2-RECATR1
              WHEN DB2-RECATR2
                MOVE CTE-UGE0000          TO UGNCTABA-COD-ERROR
                MOVE 'RECURSO ATRAPADO '  TO UGNCTABA-VAR1-ERROR
                MOVE 'UGDTT37'            TO UGNCTABA-VAR2-ERROR
                PERFORM 300-FINAL
      *
             WHEN OTHER
               MOVE CTE-90                 TO UGNCTABA-COD-RETURN
               MOVE CTE-UGE0000            TO UGNCTABA-COD-ERROR
               MOVE 'ERROR SELECT UGDTT37' TO UGNCTABA-VAR1-ERROR
               MOVE 'SECCION 9649.CGO:'    TO UGNCTABA-VAR2-ERROR(1:17)
               MOVE SQLCODE                TO UGNCTABA-VAR2-ERROR(18:)
               PERFORM 300-FINAL
           END-EVALUATE
           MOVE '130-CNS-PORC-INCEN'     TO WTRC0-PARRAFO
           MOVE 'TERMINA PERFORM 130'    TO WTRC0-DESCRIPCION
           MOVE SPACES                   TO WTRC0-VALOR-ALF.
      *    PERFORM 998-ESCRIBIR-CNTRACE.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      *                                                                *
      *                       200-PROCESO                              *
      ******************************************************************
       200-PROCESO.
      *
           MOVE '200-PROCESO  '           TO WTRC0-PARRAFO
           MOVE 'INGRESA PERFORM 2-  '    TO WTRC0-DESCRIPCION
           MOVE SPACES                    TO WTRC0-VALOR-ALF
      *
      *COL08-I
           MOVE UGNCTABA-SUBPRO           TO WS-SUBPRO
      *COL08-F
           PERFORM 210-VALIDAR-LEASING
           PERFORM 215-VALIDA-COBERT
      *
           IF SI-SUBPRO-LEASING AND WS-VR-OPCOMP > ZEROS
               COMPUTE UGNCTABA-IMPFINAN =
                                      UGNCTABA-IMPFINAN - WS-VR-OPCOMP
           END-IF
      *
           PERFORM 220-VALIDAR-ENTRADA
           PERFORM 230-CNS-UGDTLQS
      *
      *COL01-I
      *COL03-INI
      *    IF UGNCTABA-SUBPRO = CTE-5099 OR SI-SUBPRO-LEASING
      *       MOVE WS-TAE-PISO            TO WS-TAE
      *    END-IF
      *COL01-FIN
              MOVE WS-TAE-PISO            TO WS-TAE
      *COL03-FIN
           PERFORM 240-CALC-PRIM-CUOTA
      *
           IF SI-SUBPRO-LEASING AND WS-VR-OPCOMP > 0
              PERFORM 250-CALC-INT-LEASING
           END-IF
           PERFORM 260-RESTO-CALCULOS
           IF UGNCTABA-OPCION = CTE-C
             PERFORM 270-PROCESAR-LINEAS
           ELSE
             PERFORM 270-PROCESAR-LINEAS
                UNTIL (WS-FECHA-FINAL = WS-FECHA-1 AND
                       WS-FECHA-FINAL = WS-FECHA-2)
      *COL11-I
      **     CONTINUE
      *COL11-F
      *     IF SW-SI-SUB-COB
      *       PERFORM 281-CALC-VTU-COBER
      *     END-IF
      *     IF SI-SUBPRO-LEASING AND SW-NO-SUB-COB
      *      PERFORM 282-CALC-VTU-PORL
      *     END-IF
      *     IF NO-SUBPRO-LEASING AND SW-NO-SUB-COB
      *      PERFORM 280-CALC-VTU-PORC
      *     END-IF
      *COL11-I
            IF SW-SI-SUB-COB
              PERFORM 281-CALC-VTU-COBER
            END-IF
            IF SI-SUBPRO-LEASING AND SW-NO-SUB-COB
             PERFORM 282-CALC-VTU-PORL
            END-IF
            IF NO-SUBPRO-LEASING AND SW-NO-SUB-COB
             PERFORM 280-CALC-VTU-PORC
            END-IF
      *COL11-F
           END-IF
      *
           MOVE '200-PROCESO  '           TO WTRC0-PARRAFO
           MOVE 'TERMINA PERFORM 2-  '    TO WTRC0-DESCRIPCION
           MOVE SPACES                    TO WTRC0-VALOR-ALF.
      *    PERFORM 998-ESCRIBIR-CNTRACE.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      *                     210-VALIDAR-LEASING                        *
      * VALIDAR SI EL SUBPRODCUTO ESTA MARCADO - LEASING HABITACIONAL  *
      ******************************************************************
       210-VALIDAR-LEASING.
      *
           MOVE '210-VALIDAR-LEASING '    TO WTRC0-PARRAFO
           MOVE 'INGRESA PERFORM 210 '    TO WTRC0-DESCRIPCION
           MOVE SPACES                    TO WTRC0-VALOR-ALF
      *
           SET NO-SUBPRO-LEASING          TO TRUE
           INITIALIZE UGTCT37
                      WS-VLR-IMPORTE
                      WS-VR-OPCOMP
                      WS-PORC-OP
                      WS-LIMINF
                      WS-LIMSUP

      *COL07-I
           EVALUATE UGNCTABA-SUBPRO
           WHEN 'HIPO'
              MOVE CTE-5821                  TO UGNCTABA-SUBPRO
           WHEN 'LEAS'
              MOVE CTE-5824                  TO UGNCTABA-SUBPRO
           WHEN 'COMC'
              MOVE CTE-5886                  TO UGNCTABA-SUBPRO
           WHEN 'REMO'
              MOVE CTE-5691                  TO UGNCTABA-SUBPRO
           END-EVALUATE
      *COL07-F
           MOVE CTE-1250                     TO T37-SECCION
           MOVE UGNCTABA-SUBPRO              TO T37-ELEMENTO(1:4)

             EXEC SQL
                 SELECT RESTO
                   INTO :T37-RESTO
                   FROM UGDTT37
                  WHERE SECCION  = :T37-SECCION
                    AND ELEMENTO = :T37-ELEMENTO
             END-EXEC

           MOVE SQLCODE                       TO DB2-RETURN-CDE

           EVALUATE TRUE
             WHEN DB2-OK
              MOVE T37-RESTO(8:2)             TO WS-LIMINF
              MOVE T37-RESTO(11:2)            TO WS-LIMSUP
      *
              SET SI-SUBPRO-LEASING           TO TRUE
              PERFORM 211-SUBPRO-COBLH
             WHEN DB2-NOTFND
               CONTINUE
              WHEN DB2-RECATR1
              WHEN DB2-RECATR2
                MOVE CTE-UGE0000          TO UGNCTABA-COD-ERROR
                MOVE 'RECURSO ATRAPADO '  TO UGNCTABA-VAR1-ERROR
                MOVE 'UGDTT37'            TO UGNCTABA-VAR2-ERROR
                PERFORM 300-FINAL
      *
             WHEN OTHER
               MOVE CTE-90                 TO UGNCTABA-COD-RETURN
               MOVE CTE-UGE0000            TO UGNCTABA-COD-ERROR
               MOVE 'ERROR SELECT UGDTT37' TO UGNCTABA-VAR1-ERROR
               MOVE 'SECCION 1250.CGO:'    TO UGNCTABA-VAR2-ERROR(1:17)
               MOVE SQLCODE                TO UGNCTABA-VAR2-ERROR(18:)
               PERFORM 300-FINAL
           END-EVALUATE
      *
           MOVE '210-VALIDAR-LEASING '    TO WTRC0-PARRAFO
           MOVE 'TERMINA PERFORM 210 '    TO WTRC0-DESCRIPCION
           MOVE SPACES                    TO WTRC0-VALOR-ALF.
      *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *                         211-SUBPRO-COBLH                       *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       211-SUBPRO-COBLH.
      *
           MOVE '211-SUBPRO-COBLH'        TO WTRC0-PARRAFO
           MOVE 'INGRESA PERFORM 211 '    TO WTRC0-DESCRIPCION
           MOVE SPACES                    TO WTRC0-VALOR-ALF
      *

           IF UGNCTABA-PORCOMP-ALF EQUAL LOW-VALUES OR SPACES
             MOVE CTE-10                 TO UGNCTABA-COD-RETURN
             MOVE CTE-UGE0000            TO UGNCTABA-COD-ERROR
             MOVE 'SUBP. LEASING HABIT.' TO UGNCTABA-VAR1-ERROR
             MOVE 'REQUIERE OPC. COMPRA' TO UGNCTABA-VAR2-ERROR
